  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&prime;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> <br >Which is increasing in  <math><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>∞</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <br >Also,   <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br > <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mi> </mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math> <br > <math><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mi> </mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi> </mi><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <br >Hence, an odd function",
